WEBVTT

00:07.625 --> 00:09.250
[rain pouring]

00:09.333 --> 00:11.916
[tense music playing]

00:12.750 --> 00:14.875
[Shimura] Goodbye, Asamiya.

00:17.166 --> 00:19.250
Hey! Stop!

00:29.708 --> 00:30.833
Tatsuya!

00:30.916 --> 00:34.250
-[thunder crashing]
-[Shimura splashes]

00:36.083 --> 00:38.916
[Toru whimpering]

00:41.000 --> 00:43.916
-[rain pouring on live stream]
-[boy] What, what do you want?

00:44.625 --> 00:46.166
-[blows thudding]
-[boy] Hey! [groans]

00:46.250 --> 00:49.041
Like a savior, a hero appeared
out of nowhere.

00:49.125 --> 00:51.583
-[boy yelping, groaning]
-[Shimura] And saved me.

00:52.500 --> 00:54.125
[boys yelping, groaning]

00:54.208 --> 00:55.708
Why are you here?

00:55.791 --> 00:57.208
[boys groaning] Ah!

00:57.708 --> 00:59.125
[music intensifies]

00:59.208 --> 01:01.583
[boy groaning, coughing]

01:05.500 --> 01:06.416
[music stops]

01:06.500 --> 01:07.625
Let's go.

01:07.708 --> 01:09.333
[boys coughing, grunting]

01:13.916 --> 01:15.708
[Shimura] And this hero

01:16.625 --> 01:19.958
was insanely strong… and cool.

01:21.666 --> 01:22.666
[laughs softly]

01:22.750 --> 01:27.583
[whimpering]

01:31.750 --> 01:33.500
Asamiya, you okay?

01:33.583 --> 01:35.708
Yeah. I'm just fine.

01:37.166 --> 01:41.208
[Shimura] But truthfully…
I couldn't help myself.

01:44.500 --> 01:47.125
I couldn't help but resent this hero.

01:49.750 --> 01:51.750
[thunder rumbling]

01:51.833 --> 01:52.916
Let's go.

01:53.000 --> 01:55.000
[gentle music playing]

01:57.875 --> 01:59.750
But shortly afterwards,

02:00.750 --> 02:03.416
a feeling of loathing overcame me.

02:04.375 --> 02:06.041
for feeling this way.

02:10.875 --> 02:12.291
Oh, Shimura.

02:29.833 --> 02:32.375
[sobbing]

02:32.958 --> 02:35.708
[Shimura] The nightmare
finally came to an end.

02:35.791 --> 02:37.750
[thunder rumbling]

02:40.125 --> 02:41.625
And so did…

02:43.333 --> 02:44.541
my life.

02:46.666 --> 02:52.458
VIRAL HIT

02:55.166 --> 02:56.125
WHAT'S THIS?

02:56.208 --> 02:57.666
IS HE BACK FOR REAL?!

02:57.750 --> 02:58.750
LONG OVERDUE!

02:58.833 --> 03:00.625
[Hamaken] Sorry to keep you waiting.

03:00.708 --> 03:04.291
Hamaken TV is relaunching itself.

03:04.375 --> 03:08.416
From now on, there will be
no more here's Mr Nice Guy, you see?

03:08.500 --> 03:12.208
Hey! You better get yourself ready for it.

03:12.291 --> 03:13.666
SCUMBAG ACTIVATED LOL

03:13.750 --> 03:14.750
LOVE THIS VERSION

03:14.833 --> 03:17.333
I even brought a guest for you today.

03:17.416 --> 03:20.541
We've had him made up nicely.
It wasn't easy!

03:20.625 --> 03:22.458
Yeah! That's why I said
that I would do it.

03:22.541 --> 03:23.375
POOR GUY LOL

03:24.041 --> 03:25.583
Hey.

03:26.708 --> 03:30.458
Is it true that you're
the editor for Viral Hit? Yeah?

03:30.541 --> 03:31.625
[giggles]

03:31.708 --> 03:33.958
What? You didn't have
any friends in real life,

03:34.041 --> 03:35.708
so you turned to the Internet?

03:35.791 --> 03:37.250
What a loser! [giggles]

03:37.333 --> 03:39.500
-Are you listening?
-[pensive music playing]

03:39.583 --> 03:41.791
[girl 1] She asked if you could hear us.

03:42.375 --> 03:44.416
[girl 2] Wait. She's serious?

03:44.500 --> 03:47.083
[girl 3] What's with her?
She's got problems.

03:47.166 --> 03:48.500
[girl 1 scoffs] Freak.

03:48.583 --> 03:51.125
Rest in peace, Shimura.

03:51.208 --> 03:53.291
-Oh, come back!
-[boy 1] We'll miss you!

03:53.375 --> 03:54.833
[boys laughing]

03:54.916 --> 03:55.833
Edit these for me.

03:55.916 --> 03:57.416
I want them done by lunch.

03:58.083 --> 03:59.583
Uh, hang on though--

03:59.666 --> 04:00.833
[loud slam]

04:03.375 --> 04:04.416
[groans]

04:04.500 --> 04:06.166
You'll do it, won't you?

04:07.125 --> 04:08.250
[splutters] Of course.

04:08.333 --> 04:11.375
Just leave it to me.
I'll get on it now. Yes.

04:12.666 --> 04:14.250
[pensive music continues]

04:14.333 --> 04:16.083
VIRAL HIT'S GONE FOR GOOD

04:16.166 --> 04:18.166
SHIMURA, YOU STILL ALIVE? LOL

04:18.250 --> 04:20.083
THIS CHANNEL IS DEAD LOLOL

04:22.041 --> 04:23.625
They're all idiots.

04:24.875 --> 04:26.416
ARE YOU OKAY?
I'M WORRIED.

04:26.500 --> 04:27.500
PLEASE REPLY

04:27.583 --> 04:29.583
[indistinct chatter]

04:31.250 --> 04:34.458
Shimura flaked on us.
Asamiya, you know why?

04:34.541 --> 04:37.416
Ah, it's, uh, possible
he's not feeling well.

04:37.500 --> 04:38.958
Oh, I know why he's away.

04:39.041 --> 04:41.083
-Wait, what?
-Look what I found yesterday.

04:41.833 --> 04:44.291
-[man 1] Wait, is that Shimura?
-[laughter on video]

04:44.375 --> 04:45.333
Man, that's brutal.

04:45.416 --> 04:46.625
[man 2 laughing]

04:46.708 --> 04:49.750
Asamiya, don't tell me
that's your voice in the video.

04:50.375 --> 04:51.500
Oh, definitely not.

04:51.583 --> 04:53.000
[man 2] I think it is.

04:53.083 --> 04:55.375
I'd rather be dead than be seen like that.

04:56.125 --> 04:58.708
[man 1] I'd be so embarrassed,
I'd never leave home.

04:58.791 --> 05:01.000
[laughs] Naked on the ground is
the ultimate humiliation.

05:01.083 --> 05:03.458
-[man 1] Yeah, tell me about it.
-[man 2 laughing]

05:03.541 --> 05:05.708
I think the two of you are very cruel.

05:06.625 --> 05:07.875
[man 2] What?

05:07.958 --> 05:10.041
No, just forget it.

05:10.708 --> 05:11.875
Yeah.

05:12.583 --> 05:14.208
I don't think he came to school.

05:15.125 --> 05:16.375
Oh dear.

05:16.958 --> 05:18.958
I'm worried about his injuries.

05:19.041 --> 05:20.458
[Ogi] He's probably fine.

05:20.958 --> 05:22.166
What worries me

05:23.166 --> 05:24.916
is that he lost his dignity.

05:26.666 --> 05:29.000
That's one thing we can't help him with.

05:35.708 --> 05:39.041
-[pop music playing over speakers]
-Huh? Oh, you bought the mascara?

05:39.125 --> 05:42.291
I recommend it.
I want everyone to try it out.

05:43.333 --> 05:44.208
HOW'S SHIMURA?

05:44.291 --> 05:45.708
IS VIRAL HIT OVER?

05:45.791 --> 05:46.750
HE WAS TOO COCKY

05:46.833 --> 05:48.500
Viral Hit?

05:49.291 --> 05:50.125
Shimura?

05:50.208 --> 05:51.916
IS SHIMURA COMING TO SCHOOL??

05:52.000 --> 05:53.125
DO A COLLAB PLZ LOL

05:53.208 --> 05:54.375
Oh, you guys!

05:54.458 --> 05:57.208
All of this "Shimura, Shimura,"
it's annoying.

05:57.291 --> 05:59.666
Forget about him. It's all over.

06:02.083 --> 06:04.083
[birds twittering]

06:12.583 --> 06:14.041
[doorbell buzzing]

06:17.416 --> 06:19.583
[doorbell buzzing]

06:36.250 --> 06:38.375
Nice to meet you… I guess.

06:44.458 --> 06:45.500
[Kaho] I see.

06:46.291 --> 06:48.458
It's good you're worried about him too.

06:49.416 --> 06:51.875
[Aki] I feel like I'm partially to blame.

06:51.958 --> 06:53.583
[Kaho] Maybe we both are.

06:54.083 --> 06:56.833
[Aki] What do you mean?
All you did was go on a date with him.

06:56.916 --> 06:57.750
[Kaho] What?

06:57.833 --> 07:00.208
[Kaho] I… I mean, it wasn't really a date.

07:03.625 --> 07:08.791
If he runs away now… then he'll
spend the rest of his life running.

07:10.125 --> 07:12.625
-And that worries me.
-Why's that?

07:14.208 --> 07:18.250
I think that… his life, it has a value.

07:19.041 --> 07:21.875
Were you… a part of his team?

07:23.208 --> 07:25.083
Yes, sort of, I guess.

07:26.500 --> 07:27.500
I see.

07:29.625 --> 07:33.458
I wish… I knew where he was, that's all.

07:34.375 --> 07:35.750
Sorry to take up your time.

07:35.833 --> 07:38.166
[sighs] Mm. It's good we talked.

07:38.666 --> 07:39.666
Take care.

07:46.583 --> 07:48.708
I guess we're all alike.

07:50.541 --> 07:52.458
Hamaken TV!

07:52.541 --> 07:53.666
INSTANT MENACE LOL

07:53.708 --> 07:57.500
Today, I'll have Kanegon who knows
Shimura pretty well now, I think.

07:57.583 --> 07:59.583
Tell us the true story about Viral Hit.

07:59.666 --> 08:00.750
Huh?

08:00.833 --> 08:01.750
[boys laugh]

08:01.833 --> 08:03.000
[grunts]

08:03.083 --> 08:05.291
-[boy 1] Ready?
-[boy 2] Okay, we're set.

08:05.375 --> 08:09.041
You be completely honest now.
What was Shimura like?

08:09.125 --> 08:11.541
Uh… He, uh…

08:12.333 --> 08:15.583
-Shi… Shimura was--
-Shimura was what? Tell us. Come on.

08:18.833 --> 08:21.166
Shi… Shimura was…

08:21.666 --> 08:23.958
Let's take over the world
with this channel.

08:24.041 --> 08:25.708
You did it, Shimura!

08:26.208 --> 08:29.166
[Shimura] Thank you!
You helped me get my senses!

08:29.250 --> 08:32.916
Today we become known as Viral Hit!

08:33.500 --> 08:35.500
[breathing heavily]]

08:36.083 --> 08:38.583
R… really.

08:39.583 --> 08:41.000
He was a hideous guy.

08:41.083 --> 08:43.500
[straining] Oh! Oh! Was he now?

08:44.000 --> 08:46.375
-He was all about--
-Yeah? What?

08:46.458 --> 08:49.833
All he cared about was going viral
and getting donations.

08:49.916 --> 08:53.583
Ah, yes! And that's why he lied
and accused me of being a fraud!

08:53.666 --> 08:54.916
Uh-huh.

08:55.000 --> 08:57.833
And he staged
all those fight videos, didn't he?

08:58.333 --> 09:02.791
Yeah, he did. That guy will do
anything for money.

09:04.000 --> 09:06.250
But wait.
You're friends with him, aren't you?

09:06.333 --> 09:07.708
What are you talking about?

09:07.791 --> 09:11.000
Why would I want to be
friends with that loser?

09:11.583 --> 09:14.916
I don't ever… wanna see him again.

09:15.708 --> 09:18.208
You heard it. You guys get it now?

09:18.750 --> 09:22.541
The next video is going to be
where Shimura apologizes

09:22.625 --> 09:24.875
for tricking you
into thinking he's a hero.

09:24.958 --> 09:27.500
You'll love it!

09:27.583 --> 09:29.416
Okay!

09:29.500 --> 09:31.958
-This is seriously blowing up.
-[Hamaken] This is great content.

09:32.041 --> 09:33.166
HAMAKEN'S GETTING REVENGE

09:33.250 --> 09:35.583
Seems I'm a better producer than you, huh?

09:35.666 --> 09:37.291
Yeah, you definitely are.

09:37.375 --> 09:39.750
-Where is Shimura now?
-[whimpering]

09:39.833 --> 09:41.416
[Toru] Ow! You're hurting me!

09:41.500 --> 09:43.291
How long is he going to be
skipping school for?

09:43.375 --> 09:45.541
-I don't know--
-Tell me the truth! I wanna know.

09:45.625 --> 09:46.666
You bring him to me.

09:46.750 --> 09:49.708
I told you! I don't have
anything to do with him anymore!

09:49.791 --> 09:52.208
You're lying, aren't you? Aren't you?!

09:52.291 --> 09:55.166
Who would ever believe
what you're saying, hey? Hey?

09:55.250 --> 09:57.541
Do you have any idea
what you've done to me?

09:58.041 --> 10:01.458
You go get him and drag his ass back here.
You understand?

10:01.541 --> 10:02.708
[Toru] Okay, I will.

10:02.791 --> 10:05.916
I promise, I will.
I'll do it. I'll do it.

10:06.000 --> 10:06.875
[Toru straining]

10:07.791 --> 10:09.625
[gags, shudders]

10:16.708 --> 10:17.541
[Aki] Hey!

10:17.625 --> 10:19.625
[indistinct chatter]

10:22.958 --> 10:24.541
How's he holding up?

10:25.250 --> 10:27.125
-Whoa!
-How the hell should I know?

10:27.208 --> 10:29.041
Why does everyone keep asking me that?

10:33.583 --> 10:35.166
This is all his fault.

10:36.708 --> 10:38.291
He brought it on.

10:39.875 --> 10:42.291
-He needs to come back to school--
-Where are you going?

10:42.375 --> 10:44.791
The hospital! I need to find where he is.

10:44.875 --> 10:46.250
The hospital?

10:48.416 --> 10:50.125
It's where she is.

10:51.708 --> 10:53.000
His mother.

10:56.500 --> 10:59.333
[footsteps departing]

11:01.541 --> 11:03.000
[nurse] Is that for your son?

11:03.083 --> 11:04.166
Mm-hmm.

11:05.208 --> 11:09.166
If I wasn't so sick,
I'd be able to do this so quickly.

11:09.666 --> 11:12.666
Ah, don't push
yourself too hard. Mrs. Shimura.

11:14.458 --> 11:16.416
Oh! Are you visiting someone?

11:16.500 --> 11:18.666
Uh, yeah. Yeah, that's right.

11:23.916 --> 11:25.125
Hello.

11:25.208 --> 11:28.916
Uh, do… do you happen to know
where Shimura is?

11:29.000 --> 11:30.250
I can't find him anywhere.

11:31.416 --> 11:32.625
You need him?

11:33.958 --> 11:37.375
Oh. So sorry you came all this way.

11:37.916 --> 11:40.125
He hasn't visited me in a few days.

11:41.166 --> 11:43.000
Apparently, he's busy.

11:43.541 --> 11:46.083
Oh, I see. I understand.

11:47.250 --> 11:48.291
Are you…

11:49.875 --> 11:50.791
Kaneko?

11:51.708 --> 11:52.666
Uh…

11:54.000 --> 11:56.000
-Yes.
-Oh, that's great!

11:57.041 --> 12:00.958
He told me about you
with a big smile on his face.

12:01.541 --> 12:03.833
He said you were
his first friend in class.

12:05.541 --> 12:09.375
Thanks to you,
he actually enjoys going to school.

12:10.916 --> 12:13.875
-I'm like this, you know. [chuckles]
-[tender music playing]

12:13.958 --> 12:16.208
I put a lot of burden on him.

12:16.708 --> 12:19.833
I was worried
he wasn't having fun at school.

12:23.291 --> 12:27.041
Thank you for being there for him.
His first friend.

12:31.041 --> 12:31.958
Yeah.

12:35.958 --> 12:37.958
[cries softly]

12:39.000 --> 12:40.250
[firmly] Excuse me.

12:51.500 --> 12:53.500
[music fades]

13:13.041 --> 13:14.916
Go on! Jump then!

13:17.875 --> 13:18.916
It'll hurt

13:19.958 --> 13:22.125
a lot more than the punches you took.

13:24.041 --> 13:25.250
Leave me alone.

13:27.333 --> 13:28.500
My life…

13:30.916 --> 13:32.833
it's all over now.

13:34.666 --> 13:37.250
You saw how I embarrassed myself.

13:39.416 --> 13:41.833
There's no point continuing on.

13:43.583 --> 13:44.916
I'm better off

13:45.416 --> 13:46.750
being dead.

13:49.791 --> 13:52.083
[dreamy music playing]

14:04.458 --> 14:05.333
[gasps]

14:07.708 --> 14:08.708
Huh?

14:13.625 --> 14:14.791
Uh…

14:18.000 --> 14:20.166
They're all waiting for you, you know.

14:21.916 --> 14:24.916
Viral Hit subscriber numbers
are increasing, even now.

14:25.000 --> 14:26.916
[poignant music playing]

14:27.000 --> 14:28.000
Who cares?!

14:30.208 --> 14:33.375
The next video will draw
a huge viewership.

14:33.458 --> 14:36.416
-I don't care about that!
-This is a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity!

14:36.500 --> 14:38.750
That's enough! Leave me alone now!

14:41.625 --> 14:43.333
Okay. [sniffs]

14:43.875 --> 14:44.750
Forget it.

14:49.291 --> 14:52.083
I've been here a few times myself.

14:57.166 --> 14:59.666
Go kill yourself somewhere else
if you want to die.

15:06.958 --> 15:08.750
[panting, grunting]

15:13.000 --> 15:14.916
Hey, Tatsuya.

15:15.000 --> 15:15.833
Huh?

15:16.916 --> 15:17.750
Someone's here.

15:17.833 --> 15:19.416
[panting]

15:23.750 --> 15:25.958
[Ogi] It's been a month since it happened.

15:26.750 --> 15:29.250
He hasn't shown up to work
in all that time.

15:30.833 --> 15:33.791
And he hasn't… answered any calls.

15:35.666 --> 15:38.875
Maybe he's just disappeared, forever?

15:42.375 --> 15:44.000
-You've failed!
-[groaning]

15:44.083 --> 15:45.916
-Huh?
-[groaning]

15:46.000 --> 15:47.375
How are you going to fix this, huh?

15:47.458 --> 15:48.333
FAILED THE MISSION LOL

15:48.416 --> 15:51.708
[gasping] It's true.
He's not at home or anywhere.

15:51.791 --> 15:54.500
-None of your sorry excuses!
-[groaning]

15:56.125 --> 15:58.541
My viewers, they're getting impatient.

15:58.625 --> 16:01.083
I know. What if you sent him a video?

16:01.750 --> 16:03.333
Show him what Kaneko's going through.

16:03.416 --> 16:06.250
-Great idea. Here, film this.
-[boy 1 laughs] Yeah, nice.

16:06.333 --> 16:07.250
[boy 2 laughs]

16:07.333 --> 16:10.458
Okay, get up! You tell him.

16:10.541 --> 16:13.500
You tell Shimura to get his ass over here.

16:14.333 --> 16:16.791
Come on, say it. You want more, huh?

16:16.875 --> 16:18.500
You want more of this, do you?

16:18.583 --> 16:20.375
Huh? Go on, now.

16:20.458 --> 16:22.833
As soon as he arrives, you're free to go.

16:23.333 --> 16:26.041
Say it. Tell him to come here, now!

16:26.125 --> 16:28.166
[crying]

16:33.291 --> 16:35.708
Sh… Shi… Shimura.

16:35.791 --> 16:38.708
He said you were
his first friend in class.

16:40.750 --> 16:41.666
Can you…

16:41.750 --> 16:45.333
[no audio]

16:45.958 --> 16:47.500
[crying]

16:48.750 --> 16:49.833
Don't…

16:50.291 --> 16:52.291
come to the school, he'll kill you!

16:53.583 --> 16:55.666
[Hamaken] You asked for it.  Bastard!

16:56.791 --> 16:58.291
You think you're smart, do you?

16:58.375 --> 17:00.750
Huh? Hey? Hey?

17:01.166 --> 17:02.958
[grunting]

17:03.041 --> 17:04.750
You must have a death wish.

17:04.833 --> 17:06.541
-[blows thudding]
-[roars]

17:06.625 --> 17:08.333
-[object rumbles]
-[Hamaken] Yeah?

17:08.708 --> 17:10.000
Come on!

17:10.083 --> 17:11.500
[Rumi] Hamaken!

17:12.041 --> 17:13.250
What?!

17:15.416 --> 17:17.125
[Toru coughs, whimpers]

17:18.333 --> 17:21.333
-[Toru coughing]
-[snare drum playing The Long March]

17:21.416 --> 17:22.958
Finally, he's here.

17:23.041 --> 17:24.625
[tense music playing]

17:25.291 --> 17:26.250
[breathing heavily]

17:33.416 --> 17:34.958
[music swells]

17:35.791 --> 17:36.791
[Toru groans]

17:38.666 --> 17:39.833
Kanegon.

17:41.375 --> 17:42.458
Roll the camera.

17:44.708 --> 17:45.625
[grunts]

17:48.000 --> 17:50.166
[music builds]

17:51.625 --> 17:53.041
And another thing.

17:56.958 --> 17:58.500
Remember you're not alone.

18:03.916 --> 18:06.666
[phone buzzing]

18:15.375 --> 18:16.583
[Shimura] Are you rolling,

18:17.875 --> 18:18.833
Kanegon?

18:23.500 --> 18:24.500
[exhales]

18:25.708 --> 18:27.000
[Toru grunts]

18:27.958 --> 18:29.833
The title of this next video

18:30.375 --> 18:32.541
is "How To Defeat a Thug."

18:32.625 --> 18:33.458
HE'S BAAACK!

18:38.208 --> 18:40.833
Guess you don't
have to worry anymore.  Look.

18:42.500 --> 18:44.166
THE UNDERDOG STRIKES BACK!

18:44.250 --> 18:46.208
I NEED YOU TO WIN THIS ONE

18:47.041 --> 18:48.458
You've kept me waiting.

18:48.541 --> 18:50.875
I didn't come here for you.

18:50.958 --> 18:54.416
Oh, I see. You need money that bad, hey?

18:54.500 --> 18:55.583
Huh?

18:55.666 --> 18:57.375
You filthy asshole.

18:57.458 --> 18:59.791
[suspenseful music playing]

19:00.958 --> 19:04.875
HOW TO BEAT A THUG IN A FIGHT

19:05.458 --> 19:07.916
[TOU-KEI] You want to beat up a thug
who's been tormenting you?

19:08.666 --> 19:12.125
If you're serious about taking them on,
then I'll teach you.

19:12.791 --> 19:14.625
I hope you can keep up.

19:15.625 --> 19:21.000
Fighting secrets, Rule One:
A body of steel.

19:21.500 --> 19:25.041
It's impossible for an amateur fighter
to dodge every attack.

19:25.125 --> 19:28.708
Instead, your focus should be
on building a strong body

19:28.791 --> 19:30.458
that can withstand blows.

19:30.541 --> 19:31.458
[Shimura grunting]

19:31.541 --> 19:33.583
[TOU-KEI] After you've built
your outer muscle,

19:33.666 --> 19:35.458
work on the deeper muscle.

19:35.541 --> 19:39.375
Strengthen your core
so that you can counterattack.

19:40.250 --> 19:44.875
After bodybuilding exercises,
eat high-quality protein.

19:44.958 --> 19:49.875
While muscle is important in a fight,
your weight can't be neglected either.

19:49.958 --> 19:53.291
Eat plenty of food
so that you can bulk up.

19:53.375 --> 19:54.916
[Shimura panting]

19:55.000 --> 19:58.833
Fighting Secrets, Rule Two: Stamina.

19:58.916 --> 20:02.875
All that training is useless
if you don't have stamina.

20:02.958 --> 20:05.875
Strive to improve
cardio respiratory fitness

20:05.958 --> 20:08.083
and muscular endurance.

20:08.166 --> 20:10.083
And, just so you know,

20:10.166 --> 20:13.708
you can't expect
any dramatic changes in your body

20:13.791 --> 20:15.375
from just a few weeks of training.

20:15.458 --> 20:16.500
Huh?

20:16.583 --> 20:23.250
But… if you master this one technique,
you might just have a shot at winning.

20:23.333 --> 20:26.958
Fighting Secrets, Rule Number Three!

20:27.041 --> 20:29.875
This is the finishing move.

20:31.583 --> 20:33.166
[music fades]

20:33.250 --> 20:34.083
Come on

20:37.791 --> 20:38.916
Okay.

20:39.958 --> 20:41.541
[Hamaken] You're fucking dead!

20:41.625 --> 20:43.125
[tense rock music playing]

20:43.208 --> 20:44.708
[both grunting]

20:45.875 --> 20:46.916
[yells] Mm-uh!

20:47.000 --> 20:48.250
[students gasp, scream]

20:48.333 --> 20:49.416
[Hamaken snarling]

20:51.291 --> 20:52.500
[Hamaken yelling, grunting]

20:56.083 --> 20:57.958
-[yells] Ah! You little bastard!
-Oh!

20:58.041 --> 20:59.541
[Hamaken yells] Ah! Ah!

20:59.625 --> 21:00.708
[students gasping]

21:01.458 --> 21:03.000
[students screaming]

21:04.541 --> 21:07.458
[grunting]

21:10.875 --> 21:12.000
Ugh!

21:12.791 --> 21:13.916
Ugh!

21:14.000 --> 21:15.041
[straining]

21:16.666 --> 21:19.875
[grunts] You think you can mess with me?!

21:19.958 --> 21:21.875
-[students scream]
-[Hamaken] Weakling!

21:21.958 --> 21:23.250
[both grunting]

21:23.333 --> 21:24.291
[Hamaken] Shithead!

21:24.375 --> 21:25.583
[roars]

21:25.666 --> 21:27.666
[grunting]

21:28.958 --> 21:30.416
[Hamaken exhales sharply] Ah!

21:33.500 --> 21:35.666
[music continues]

21:37.625 --> 21:40.000
What's wrong?
Is that all you got?

21:40.750 --> 21:42.000
Come on, fight.

21:43.208 --> 21:45.958
[straining]

21:46.041 --> 21:49.000
-[hopeful music playing]
-[panting]

21:57.333 --> 21:59.041
-[exhaling]
-[music fades]

21:59.125 --> 22:01.083
[breathing deeply]

22:01.166 --> 22:03.333
[tense electronic music playing]

22:10.916 --> 22:13.000
[TOU-KEI] Are you ready to counterattack?

22:13.083 --> 22:16.291
A certain martial arts champion once said,

22:16.375 --> 22:21.166
if he had to choose just one technique
to use against a powerful opponent,

22:21.250 --> 22:22.916
this would be it.

22:23.000 --> 22:25.166
-[exhales]
-[Hamaken] You piece of trash.

22:26.458 --> 22:29.041
You've got it coming!

22:29.125 --> 22:32.000
[TOU-KEI] Turn your body
towards your kicking leg.

22:33.583 --> 22:37.666
The moment your opponent shifts
their weight onto the stepping foot,

22:39.333 --> 22:43.791
rotate your entire body
and swing your leg all the way!

22:48.500 --> 22:50.166
[loud cracking]

22:50.250 --> 22:51.916
[groans]

22:52.625 --> 22:54.083
[Shimura] Did… did I get him?

22:54.166 --> 22:55.875
[dramatic music playing]

22:56.458 --> 22:57.500
[panting]

22:57.583 --> 22:58.958
[grunting]

22:59.791 --> 23:02.083
[TOU KEI] Your efforts
will never let you down.

23:02.166 --> 23:03.166
[Shimura grunts]

23:03.250 --> 23:07.416
[TOU-KEI] For now, focus
on mastering this single technique.

23:07.500 --> 23:08.750
[grunts]

23:10.000 --> 23:12.333
[music swells]

23:12.416 --> 23:14.791
[yells] Ah!

23:20.083 --> 23:22.250
-[Hamaken groans]
-[students gasp]

23:22.333 --> 23:23.500
Shimura!

23:23.583 --> 23:24.875
[music fades]

23:26.458 --> 23:31.041
Huh? Was that a low kick, was it?
A nice try.

23:31.833 --> 23:34.916
You aim for the thigh.
You've got no idea how to fight!

23:36.291 --> 23:37.916
-[students murmur]
-[exhales]

23:40.583 --> 23:42.291
That didn't hurt at all.
And now I… [groans]

23:42.375 --> 23:43.458
THX FOR THE INPUT

23:43.541 --> 23:44.958
[Hamaken groaning]

23:45.541 --> 23:47.500
[dramatic rock music playing]

23:50.416 --> 23:52.291
[gasping]

23:54.291 --> 23:57.625
A low kick aims for the thigh,
which is padded with muscle.

23:58.375 --> 24:01.583
He went for the calf,
which isn't nearly as protected.

24:03.375 --> 24:04.250
A calf kick.

24:04.333 --> 24:06.541
-[Hamaken] Now you die!
-[grunts]

24:07.083 --> 24:08.333
-[Hamaken] Get off!
-[grunts]

24:08.416 --> 24:10.000
-[loud crack]
-[groans]

24:11.458 --> 24:13.250
-[Shimura grunting]
-[yells]

24:13.333 --> 24:15.541
[both straining]

24:15.625 --> 24:16.875
[loud crack]

24:16.958 --> 24:19.500
Yes! Yes! Go Shimura!

24:20.458 --> 24:22.833
[bellows] Ah!

24:23.333 --> 24:25.666
I'm gonna kill you!

24:25.750 --> 24:27.375
HE LANDED ANOTHER KICK!

24:27.458 --> 24:28.791
SHIMURA'S DOING GREAT

24:28.875 --> 24:30.208
HE CAN WIN?!

24:32.833 --> 24:33.833
You bastard.

24:34.416 --> 24:35.833
You little shit.

24:36.333 --> 24:38.666
[yelling] Ah! Ah!

24:44.166 --> 24:45.416
[groaning]

24:45.500 --> 24:47.208
[industrial music playing]

24:47.291 --> 24:49.708
So that's… that only move you know.

24:50.291 --> 24:52.166
I WAS THINKING THE SAME THING

24:52.250 --> 24:53.958
HAMAKEN'S GOT A POINT

24:54.041 --> 24:55.125
SHIMURA'S DONE FOR

24:56.291 --> 24:57.916
It won't work again!

24:58.625 --> 25:00.666
-[dull thud]
-[students scream]

25:01.208 --> 25:03.375
[Hamaken grunting]

25:03.458 --> 25:04.666
[Shimura shouts] Ah!

25:05.250 --> 25:06.833
[grunting]

25:07.583 --> 25:10.166
[both straining]

25:13.375 --> 25:14.250
Shimura!

25:14.333 --> 25:15.500
HE MIGHT REALLY DIE

25:15.583 --> 25:17.000
IT'S OKAY TO SURRENDER

25:17.666 --> 25:20.333
[Shimura groaning]

25:21.125 --> 25:23.583
[growling]

25:24.208 --> 25:26.000
-[grunts] Ugh!
-[students scream]

25:26.083 --> 25:29.083
-[music fades]
-[panting]

25:29.166 --> 25:31.750
[gasping]

25:31.833 --> 25:35.125
You really are one hopeless loser.

25:35.208 --> 25:36.375
[sniffles]

25:38.041 --> 25:39.375
[shudders]

25:40.541 --> 25:41.750
[Shimura] When was it

25:43.041 --> 25:45.208
that I became such a loser?

25:45.291 --> 25:48.291
[poignant electric guitar music playing]

25:48.416 --> 25:49.916
Since I was born?

25:51.041 --> 25:53.208
No. Of course, that's not true.

25:53.291 --> 25:54.208
Shimura, did you watch…

25:54.291 --> 25:56.333
[Shimura] I used to be
a perfectly ordinary student.

25:56.416 --> 25:57.250
Isn't it?

25:57.875 --> 25:58.958
-[Hamaken] You.
-Ah!

25:59.083 --> 26:00.083
[sighs]

26:00.166 --> 26:01.041
[groans]

26:01.125 --> 26:02.458
Shut up, twerp.

26:02.541 --> 26:04.208
Ah! [gasps]

26:04.291 --> 26:06.833
[Shimura] Until Hamaken showed up
in my life.

26:06.916 --> 26:08.916
-What? What? What? Huh?
-Stop it! That hurts!

26:09.000 --> 26:10.833
[Hamaken] Uh! Uh! Uh!

26:10.916 --> 26:14.166
[Shimura] I could never understand
why he always beat me up.

26:14.250 --> 26:15.708
Stop! [crying out]

26:15.791 --> 26:17.541
-[Hamaken] It hurts, does it?
-Ow! That hurts!

26:17.625 --> 26:19.875
[Shimura] There was nothing
to understand really.

26:20.458 --> 26:22.083
He never had a reason.

26:22.583 --> 26:24.000
[all laughing]

26:24.083 --> 26:27.083
[Shimura] After that,
I started hating school.

26:28.125 --> 26:31.125
I became afraid
of making eye contact with people.

26:31.208 --> 26:32.791
[tense rock music playingj]

26:32.875 --> 26:36.708
My body was always hunched over,
so I looked like a weakling.

26:40.666 --> 26:43.541
But… I…

26:51.333 --> 26:53.958
[gasping]

26:57.166 --> 27:00.625
[TOI-KEI] I'm proud of you
for getting back on your feet.

27:00.708 --> 27:02.083
[gasping]

27:03.291 --> 27:05.500
[Shimura gasping on live stream]

27:08.125 --> 27:10.333
[Hamaken] You still wanna go, huh?

27:10.416 --> 27:12.791
Yeah, sure. I'll take you.

27:13.375 --> 27:16.083
[TOU-KEI] Now, believe in yourself.

27:16.166 --> 27:18.041
[gasping]

27:18.125 --> 27:19.500
[suspenseful music playing]

27:19.583 --> 27:23.083
You're so annoying, you piece of trash!

27:24.625 --> 27:26.125
I…

27:29.208 --> 27:30.416
I…

27:32.125 --> 27:34.375
-[loud cracking]
-[Hamaken groans]

27:35.041 --> 27:36.541
[gentle classical music playing]

27:36.625 --> 27:38.666
-[TOU-KEI] Now's your chance.
-[Shimura gasps]

27:42.791 --> 27:45.541
I'm not a loser!
But you're a loser for sure!

27:50.541 --> 27:54.291
[TOU-KEI] Overhand hook!

27:57.125 --> 27:58.125
[loud crack]

27:58.208 --> 27:59.208
[loud crack]

28:00.250 --> 28:01.833
[gags, groans]

28:02.416 --> 28:05.000
[hitched breathing]

28:05.083 --> 28:06.666
[students murmuring]

28:06.750 --> 28:09.750
[Shimura gasping]

28:11.708 --> 28:13.333
I'M ACTUALLY TEARING UP

28:13.416 --> 28:14.916
THIS DESERVES A MOVIE

28:15.000 --> 28:16.250
WE'RE ALL CRYING

28:18.875 --> 28:20.500
Far out.

28:20.583 --> 28:22.208
[Shimura crying]

28:32.291 --> 28:34.291
[sobbing]

28:34.375 --> 28:35.250
[sniffing]

28:42.083 --> 28:44.000
[voice breaking] You did real good.

28:49.833 --> 28:51.458
So don't cry anymore.

28:54.583 --> 28:56.875
[crying]

28:58.916 --> 28:59.958
Shimura.

29:02.541 --> 29:03.500
LEGENDARY

29:03.583 --> 29:04.791
SHIMURA'S THE MAN

29:06.250 --> 29:07.916
That was a beautiful win.

29:08.000 --> 29:09.916
[gentle classical music continues]

29:10.000 --> 29:11.083
[laughs]

29:11.625 --> 29:12.875
[sniffles]

29:12.958 --> 29:13.875
[sighs]

29:25.791 --> 29:26.791
Shimura.

29:27.833 --> 29:29.291
I want to thank you.

29:34.333 --> 29:35.708
So, thank you.

29:40.333 --> 29:41.458
What does it say?

29:41.541 --> 29:42.375
Huh?

29:43.166 --> 29:44.333
Double?

29:44.416 --> 29:46.916
We've already hit 700,000.

29:47.416 --> 29:50.333
It's only a matter of time
before we hit one million!

29:50.416 --> 29:52.541
-[Shimura] What about the donations?
-Hey.

29:52.625 --> 29:55.250
-Let's see. It's past a million yen!
-[joyful music playing]

29:55.333 --> 30:00.541
Uh, then it's… then our share,
it's more than 600,000 yen!

30:00.625 --> 30:03.333
I thought you did it to save me.

30:03.416 --> 30:06.125
Why would I?
This was all about money. No more.

30:07.166 --> 30:10.000
You bastard. I got all emotional.

30:10.083 --> 30:11.666
-I thought you came for me!
-Oh.

30:11.750 --> 30:15.333
But aren't you the one who said
that I'd do anything for money?

30:15.416 --> 30:16.416
You were watching?

30:17.458 --> 30:19.916
Sure did. I'm a hideous guy.

30:20.500 --> 30:23.000
No wonder you don't have friends!
You're mean, ya know?

30:23.083 --> 30:24.000
Say what you want.

30:24.083 --> 30:26.791
It can hardly hurt
coming from a guy like you.

30:26.875 --> 30:28.625
-What do you mean by that?
-Ah!

30:29.333 --> 30:30.833
You want to fight?

30:30.916 --> 30:32.166
I'll take you on.

30:33.041 --> 30:33.916
[Toru grunts]

30:34.000 --> 30:36.125
-[Shimura] Don't copy me.
-[Toru] Shut up!

30:36.208 --> 30:38.541
[Toru straining, grunting]

30:38.625 --> 30:41.125
[both grunting, laughing]

30:41.208 --> 30:42.291
[Shimura] Whoa!

30:44.125 --> 30:46.166
Ah! [laughs]

30:48.916 --> 30:51.666
[grunting, laughing]

30:51.750 --> 30:52.791
[music fades]

30:52.875 --> 30:53.750
[Toru screams]

30:54.583 --> 30:55.458
[Shimura] Ah!

30:55.958 --> 30:58.166
[indistinct chatter]

30:58.250 --> 31:00.708
-[boy 1] I hope he comes today.
-[boy 2] Seriously, yesterday--

31:00.791 --> 31:02.416
-[boy 3] Hey, Shimura!
-Oh, Shimura!

31:02.500 --> 31:04.333
Oh, it's Shimura! [laughs]

31:04.416 --> 31:06.083
[boy 1] You were incredible.

31:07.041 --> 31:09.708
[Shimura] Hamaken hasn't come to school
since that day.

31:09.791 --> 31:11.291
[boy 3] It's all thanks to you!

31:11.375 --> 31:14.333
[Shimura] I know what he's afraid of
isn't silly old me.

31:14.416 --> 31:15.500
[boy 2] Me too!

31:16.208 --> 31:18.291
[Shimura] It's the reality
that he's hit rock bottom.

31:18.916 --> 31:20.500
So crazy!

31:20.583 --> 31:23.625
[boy 1] I'm really sorry
I never tried to intervene.

31:24.291 --> 31:26.333
There's nothing… you could have done.

31:26.416 --> 31:28.000
-[all chuckle, gasp]
-You're such a saint!

31:28.083 --> 31:30.958
[Shimura] I imagine
Hamaken's suffering and…

31:32.833 --> 31:35.333
Oh, it serves him right! He deserves it!

31:35.416 --> 31:37.458
[Toru] Okay! Hi! Hi!

31:37.541 --> 31:40.000
Do you all get what we can do now? Do you?

31:40.083 --> 31:41.916
Hey? It's all because of me,

31:42.000 --> 31:44.375
the producer and creator
of this great channel--

31:44.458 --> 31:46.500
Shimura, want to go to karaoke sometime?

31:46.583 --> 31:48.291
[Shimura] Huh? Oh, uh…

31:48.375 --> 31:50.333
-Mm, yeah, sure, if I'm free.
-[boys chuckle]

31:50.416 --> 31:51.958
-[boy 2] Yay!
-[boy 1] That's so good.

31:52.041 --> 31:54.041
[boy 3] We're gonna have
the best time with Shimura!

31:54.125 --> 31:55.583
[boys laughing, chattering]

31:55.666 --> 31:56.541
[music ends]

31:57.625 --> 32:00.000
-[girl 1 laughs] What? So lame!
-[girl 2] Isn't she cringe?

32:00.083 --> 32:01.375
[girl 3] Is she for real?

32:01.458 --> 32:04.875
[girl 4 laughs] They're dissing her,
saying she's Hamaken's girl.

32:04.958 --> 32:06.416
-Not even good.
-[girl 5] Seriously.

32:06.500 --> 32:07.500
[loud slam]

32:09.083 --> 32:11.125
-Let's go to the bathroom.
-[Girl 4] Let's go.

32:11.625 --> 32:13.000
[girl 5 laughs]

32:13.083 --> 32:14.416
[phone buzzing]

32:14.500 --> 32:16.500
[indistinct chattering]

32:17.250 --> 32:18.750
NEW MESSAGE

32:19.666 --> 32:22.833
INVITATION TO PARTNER
AS AN OFFICIAL INFLUENCER

32:24.958 --> 32:26.375
[students laugh]

32:27.291 --> 32:28.458
What are you doing?

32:29.125 --> 32:30.333
Oh, Aki.

32:30.416 --> 32:31.708
Where's Shimura?

32:32.666 --> 32:33.625
How would I know?

32:36.875 --> 32:37.791
What's wrong?

32:43.208 --> 32:45.125
So he's amazing. I get it.

32:46.458 --> 32:47.458
I really do.

32:48.875 --> 32:51.000
-Oh, you're jealous.
-I wouldn't call it jealousy.

32:51.083 --> 32:53.583
-Jealous men don't get the girls.
-I just said I'm not jealous!

32:57.166 --> 33:01.583
You know your job now…
is to find his next opponent.

33:05.375 --> 33:07.166
I have high hopes for you.

33:08.625 --> 33:09.625
Huh?

33:13.416 --> 33:14.916
High hopes?

33:17.125 --> 33:18.125
You do?

33:19.416 --> 33:20.708
CEO

33:20.750 --> 33:22.541
As I mentioned in my DM,

33:22.625 --> 33:25.791
we will be honored to have you join
our influencer agency, Rumi.

33:26.833 --> 33:28.958
We are part of BAD FELLOWS Group.

33:29.041 --> 33:33.250
We can get you gigs and anything
you can think of, like reality shows.

33:33.333 --> 33:35.833
Once you get more exposure
and become more well-known--

33:35.916 --> 33:36.791
Will you

33:37.875 --> 33:39.416
help me get more followers?

33:39.500 --> 33:42.083
[light piano music playing]

33:42.166 --> 33:44.625
-I want more followers.
-[chuckles]

33:46.458 --> 33:49.666
Of course. If you let me handle it.

33:51.666 --> 33:53.208
Are you free after this?

33:56.458 --> 33:59.833
['50s rock music playing]

33:59.916 --> 34:01.625
[Shimura] I caused you so much trouble.

34:01.708 --> 34:03.083
I'm terribly sorry.

34:04.125 --> 34:05.083
[clears throat]

34:06.791 --> 34:08.333
-[bell jangles]
-I'm terribly sorry--

34:08.416 --> 34:10.500
-[both yell]
-[clattering]

34:10.583 --> 34:12.750
-[Shimura] Ah, sorry about that.
-[Kaho] So sorry.

34:13.250 --> 34:14.708
I'm sorry, I didn't see you coming.

34:14.791 --> 34:16.625
Oh no, that was completely my fault.

34:16.708 --> 34:17.541
[Kaho exhales]

34:18.291 --> 34:19.666
Here. Use this.

34:19.750 --> 34:21.500
Oh, thank you.

34:22.500 --> 34:23.416
It's been a while.

34:24.583 --> 34:27.083
-[gentle electronic music playing]
-Mm. Yes, it has.

34:27.166 --> 34:28.416
[Kaho laughs]

34:30.416 --> 34:34.916
I'm very sorry… for putting you
through so much worry.

34:35.583 --> 34:41.083
I knew that you were trying to contact me,
but after you saw me like that, I…

34:43.458 --> 34:44.291
Thank you.

34:45.666 --> 34:46.875
Uh…

34:46.958 --> 34:49.416
You were trying
to protect me again, weren't you?

34:52.875 --> 34:55.916
It's all right.
You've already saved me enough.

34:57.333 --> 34:58.166
I don't think so.

34:58.375 --> 35:02.083
So it's my turn, now.
I can save you!

35:02.166 --> 35:03.416
[both laugh]

35:03.500 --> 35:04.666
That's silly.

35:09.333 --> 35:10.500
Uh, well…

35:12.208 --> 35:15.541
Would you like to go
to a café with me again?

35:16.041 --> 35:17.500
Next time, it's on me.

35:17.583 --> 35:18.875
Would I? Yes!

35:18.958 --> 35:21.250
-Oh, yay!
-[giggles]

35:21.333 --> 35:22.500
Then it's a date.

35:22.583 --> 35:23.541
Mm, a date.

35:23.625 --> 35:26.208
-See you.
-Mm. Yeah. Bye for now.

35:39.000 --> 35:40.666
[music fades]

35:40.750 --> 35:41.833
[gasps] Oh!

35:45.333 --> 35:46.291
Oh.

36:04.500 --> 36:06.458
Welcome home, Asamiya.

36:06.541 --> 36:08.000
Yes, thank you.

36:13.250 --> 36:17.541
[ominous music playing]

36:26.708 --> 36:28.166
Anything to report?

36:29.000 --> 36:31.250
I just spent a little time with Tatsuya.

36:31.333 --> 36:32.416
And, why?

36:32.875 --> 36:36.250
-We talked about the entrance exam--
-Exactly how long were you with him?

36:36.333 --> 36:37.291
Two hours.

36:38.333 --> 36:40.083
He's a fighter, is he not?

36:41.166 --> 36:44.500
Will someone like that be
beneficial to your future, Asamiya?

36:45.666 --> 36:48.958
Don't waste your time like this.
You must focus on your studies.

36:50.458 --> 36:51.291
Hmm.

36:52.791 --> 36:53.791
Thank you for the meal--

36:53.875 --> 36:56.083
You haven't been seeing
anyone else, have you?

36:56.166 --> 36:58.166
[ominous music builds]

36:58.250 --> 36:59.541
No, I haven't.

37:02.000 --> 37:04.291
[moaning]

37:06.125 --> 37:07.166
[Eiji] Rumi.

37:07.250 --> 37:08.125
[moans]

37:08.666 --> 37:09.750
You're great.

37:10.625 --> 37:12.916
[moaning continues]

37:17.500 --> 37:19.708
Whoa! 560,000!

37:19.791 --> 37:22.166
[Toru] Can you believe it?
Our channel's blowing up!

37:22.833 --> 37:25.958
This is all thanks to my producing skills.

37:26.541 --> 37:27.541
Look at this.

37:29.625 --> 37:30.833
[Aki] That's BAD FELLOWS.

37:30.916 --> 37:32.833
-Who are they?
-You don't know?

37:32.916 --> 37:37.166
It's a super popular show that pits
amateur fighters against each other.

37:37.250 --> 37:39.583
The CEO hit the jackpot with this.

37:39.666 --> 37:42.750
Now, he's expanding
into the entertainment industry.

37:42.833 --> 37:44.375
[Shimura] Mmm.

37:46.708 --> 37:48.125
Read the comments.

37:49.708 --> 37:50.708
IT LOOKS STAGED

37:50.791 --> 37:52.541
I PREFER VIRAL HIT

37:52.625 --> 37:54.125
VIRAL HIT IS LEGIT

37:55.041 --> 37:58.083
Viral Hit's channel…
it's competing with them.

37:58.166 --> 37:59.666
This affects us how?

37:59.750 --> 38:03.833
My point is, what we offer is
the real deal. It's legit.

38:03.916 --> 38:04.833
VIRAL HIT IS LEGIT

38:04.916 --> 38:06.125
Of course. And?

38:06.208 --> 38:08.666
I have the next opponent lined up for you.

38:09.458 --> 38:11.791
You see how I'm a genius producer?

38:11.875 --> 38:15.791
[jaunty music playing]

38:15.875 --> 38:18.250
[all grunting]

38:22.166 --> 38:23.125
Let's go.

38:23.625 --> 38:24.916
What do you mean? Wait, why?

38:25.000 --> 38:27.666
This is crazy.
What about the weight difference?

38:27.750 --> 38:30.166
Yeah, sure… but it'll be a great visual.

38:30.250 --> 38:32.416
I've got an idea.
Why don't you fight them?

38:32.500 --> 38:34.083
See how safe you feel.

38:34.166 --> 38:35.166
Huh?

38:35.250 --> 38:36.375
-[loud slam]
-[men grunting]

38:36.458 --> 38:37.708
[jaunty music continues]

38:37.791 --> 38:39.666
All right, get ready!

38:53.666 --> 38:54.833
Begin!

38:54.916 --> 38:55.916
-I give up!
-[music stops]

38:56.875 --> 38:58.416
[jaunty music resumes]

38:58.500 --> 39:01.541
So did you get a taste
of how it feels to fight? [chuckles]

39:01.625 --> 39:05.250
Assessing safety is an important part
of your work as a producer.

39:05.750 --> 39:07.916
Sure, but this
would have been spectacular.

39:08.000 --> 39:10.708
Next time book me a fighter on my level.

39:11.791 --> 39:13.791
You're both ganging up on me now.

39:15.166 --> 39:16.208
All right, then.

39:16.708 --> 39:18.416
Why don't you two do it yourself?

39:18.500 --> 39:20.875
Well, that's an idea.
We might just do that.

39:22.083 --> 39:23.166
Let's go.

39:23.250 --> 39:24.208
[Shimura] Mm.

39:25.125 --> 39:26.083
[music ends]

39:26.166 --> 39:27.375
They hate me.

39:29.666 --> 39:34.250
We need to develop a strategy
so we can figure out your next opponent.

39:34.333 --> 39:36.333
Be nice to do content other than fights.

39:36.416 --> 39:37.375
Mm.

39:37.875 --> 39:42.166
Oh, why don't you come to my place…
and we can brainstorm a bit.

39:42.833 --> 39:48.625
Oh, uh, my dad wouldn't…
like that much… since you live alone.

39:48.708 --> 39:50.166
You're right, yeah.

39:50.250 --> 39:52.541
I guess we'll need
to call off the meeting.

39:53.750 --> 39:54.833
Uh, no.

39:56.333 --> 39:59.333
We still need to discuss things.

40:00.291 --> 40:02.208
[pop music playing]

40:03.666 --> 40:06.208
FOLLOWERS 71,000

40:06.291 --> 40:07.250
♪ Uh-huh, uh-huh ♪

40:08.416 --> 40:10.416
[music subsides]

40:18.833 --> 40:20.916
Look. I already have
over 70,000 followers!

40:21.000 --> 40:22.541
RUMI
BEAUTY-LOVING HIGH SCHOOL GIRL (17)

40:22.625 --> 40:24.708
Rumi, you can aim much higher.

40:24.791 --> 40:27.541
Can I get to 600,000?
I want to shoot for more.

40:27.625 --> 40:30.375
Ha. Don't worry, I have a plan.

40:30.458 --> 40:31.958
-[Rumi] Mm.
-Come here.

40:34.125 --> 40:36.916
Rumi, you do know
I'll do anything for you.

40:37.000 --> 40:37.958
[chuckles]

40:39.791 --> 40:40.916
You know that.

40:41.916 --> 40:42.916
Mm-hmm.

40:43.583 --> 40:46.250
-[game music playing]
-[indistinct chatter]

40:46.333 --> 40:48.375
[game character] Don't listen to them!

40:49.250 --> 40:50.375
Kanegon.

40:51.083 --> 40:51.958
What do you want?

40:52.041 --> 40:53.458
What are you doing by yourself?

40:53.541 --> 40:54.583
You can't tell?

40:54.666 --> 40:56.500
What is it?  Are you guys fighting?

40:56.583 --> 40:57.625
Go away.

40:57.708 --> 41:00.500
[Rumi laughs] They're cruel to you.

41:01.166 --> 41:04.333
I actually appreciate how amazing you are.

41:09.916 --> 41:11.916
BARBER YASHIO

41:12.000 --> 41:15.083
[Aki humming]

41:29.958 --> 41:31.625
[dad humming]

41:33.666 --> 41:35.291
[Aki] You're in a very good mood today.

41:35.375 --> 41:36.500
Yeah.

41:36.583 --> 41:39.041
This is the first time
you've ever brought a friend here, hey?

41:39.458 --> 41:41.791
He's more like a… comrade.

41:41.875 --> 41:45.166
A comrade. So you made a friend.
That's the main thing.

41:45.250 --> 41:46.500
[Aki laughs]

41:46.583 --> 41:47.583
Hello?

41:48.083 --> 41:50.041
-Hi, come on in.
-You're late.

41:50.125 --> 41:51.541
-[Shimura] Sorry, I got lost.
-Mm?

41:51.625 --> 41:52.458
Let's get to it.

41:52.541 --> 41:53.583
Oh, yeah.

41:53.666 --> 41:55.541
I'm Shimura, sir.
We go to the same school.

41:55.625 --> 41:57.833
Oh, that's nice.

41:57.916 --> 42:00.083
Yes, so sorry to intrude.

42:00.166 --> 42:02.416
[footsteps departing]

42:02.500 --> 42:03.666
A boy?

42:04.875 --> 42:05.958
[dance music playing]

42:06.041 --> 42:08.041
[girls] Cheers! Cheers! Cheers!

42:08.125 --> 42:11.250
No way!
You're the one producing Viral Hit!

42:11.333 --> 42:12.291
It's nothing, really.

42:12.375 --> 42:15.333
Yes, I see all your videos
on Instagram too.

42:15.416 --> 42:17.125
Your channel's the talk of the town.

42:17.208 --> 42:18.041
-Oh, really?
-Mm-hmm!

42:18.125 --> 42:21.708
Well, people just don't get it.
The producer's role is the most important.

42:21.791 --> 42:23.166
Well, of course it is.

42:23.250 --> 42:25.875
It's the behind-the-scenes
that really counts.

42:25.958 --> 42:27.583
-Mature of you!
-[girl 1] Totally!

42:27.666 --> 42:28.625
-Totally.
-Totally.

42:28.708 --> 42:29.833
Oh, you think so?

42:29.916 --> 42:32.708
If it were me, I'd complain for sure.

42:32.791 --> 42:35.125
I'd say Viral Hit only got
this far because of me.

42:35.208 --> 42:36.375
Well, okay.

42:36.458 --> 42:40.125
I'm happy enough
as long as you're all happy! [chuckles]

42:40.208 --> 42:41.625
[all laughing]

42:41.708 --> 42:43.916
Ah, well, today's on me, so drink up!

42:44.000 --> 42:45.000
-Really?
-You sure?

42:45.083 --> 42:47.208
Well then, I won't hold back! Here.

42:47.291 --> 42:48.750
[all] Kanpai!

42:48.833 --> 42:50.333
[girl 1] Woo-hoo-hoo!

42:50.416 --> 42:53.416
[girls whooping, shouting]

42:53.500 --> 42:55.250
[girl 2] This is the life!

42:55.333 --> 42:56.250
[music stops]

42:57.666 --> 43:00.916
This is bad.
We didn't get a single donation.

43:01.000 --> 43:02.833
Not a single yen?

43:02.916 --> 43:05.750
This is the next opponent I'll fight!

43:06.916 --> 43:08.458
VIRAL HIT LIVE NOW

43:08.541 --> 43:10.791
[Aki] Looks like the viewers
didn't want that from you.

43:10.875 --> 43:12.166
FIGHT ALREADY

43:14.291 --> 43:18.000
-How much have we made so far?
-735,300.

43:18.666 --> 43:20.333
That's not enough.

43:20.458 --> 43:22.833
TOTAL AMOUNT DUE: 3,140,000 YEN

43:22.916 --> 43:26.041
So it has to be a fight.

43:28.916 --> 43:31.166
-[dance music playing
-Hey, Kaneko.

43:31.250 --> 43:32.333
Show us how you edit.

43:32.416 --> 43:33.666
-You really wanna know?
-Oh, yes!

43:33.750 --> 43:34.666
-Yes!
-Yes, please.

43:34.750 --> 43:36.291
Come on! Show them.

43:36.375 --> 43:38.083
-[girl 2] Yes.
-Really?

43:38.166 --> 43:39.916
Okay. [laughs]

43:40.000 --> 43:41.500
[girl 3] Oh, this is so great!

43:47.666 --> 43:50.208
-[music ends]
-Well, I should get going now.

43:50.291 --> 43:52.375
Oh, it's that late already.

43:53.583 --> 43:54.500
By the way...

43:55.541 --> 43:56.666
That video, I…

43:58.291 --> 43:59.375
You what?

43:59.458 --> 44:01.375
I, uh... Oh, never mind.

44:02.041 --> 44:04.708
[Aki] Oh, I wanted
to ask you something too.

44:05.500 --> 44:06.333
Who…

44:08.041 --> 44:09.750
is it that's teaching you to fight?

44:11.708 --> 44:13.333
[phone buzzing]

44:16.458 --> 44:19.208
HOW TO BEAT A THUG IN A FIGHT

44:19.291 --> 44:21.291
[tense music playing]

44:21.375 --> 44:22.541
Well, I've…

44:25.625 --> 44:27.166
taught myself. [chuckles]

44:28.458 --> 44:30.041
Taught yourself…

44:32.208 --> 44:33.333
See you, then.

44:42.500 --> 44:44.416
[Shimura] Aki's not the one, then.

44:47.416 --> 44:48.708
[music ends]

44:52.125 --> 44:52.958
Hmm.

44:54.833 --> 44:58.333
PASSWORD INCORRECT

45:05.875 --> 45:07.666
-[dance music playing]
-[all whooping]

45:07.750 --> 45:09.500
-Hey! I'm sorry!
-[phone ringing]

45:09.583 --> 45:10.625
More! More!

45:10.708 --> 45:12.166
Sorry! This is me!

45:12.250 --> 45:13.291
-Aw!
-Don't sit down!

45:13.375 --> 45:15.125
Aki, what's up?

45:15.208 --> 45:17.291
Have you been missing me, have you?

45:17.375 --> 45:19.666
Did you alter the password to our channel?

45:19.750 --> 45:22.583
Password? No, why would I do that?

45:22.666 --> 45:24.125
[girl 2] Here, Kanegon. Your drink.

45:24.208 --> 45:26.625
-[Toru] Hang on. Just…
-[girl 3] Come on!

45:27.916 --> 45:30.083
[ominous music playing]

45:30.166 --> 45:32.166
[phone ringing]

45:35.625 --> 45:36.541
Moshi moshi.

45:36.625 --> 45:38.625
It's an emergency. Come back right now.

45:39.583 --> 45:40.625
What emergency?

45:41.125 --> 45:42.916
The Viral Hit account status…

45:43.875 --> 45:45.875
the account's been suspended.

45:46.458 --> 45:49.291
Huh? But we were using it
just a minute ago.

45:49.375 --> 45:50.708
Someone must have hacked it.

45:50.791 --> 45:52.166
Oh my God.

45:52.250 --> 45:53.500
DEPOSIT: 735,300 YEN

45:53.583 --> 45:54.958
That means…

45:56.750 --> 46:00.208
Yes. That means
you're not getting any money.

46:02.458 --> 46:04.541
-[Shimura yells] Ah!
-[Aki] Hey.

46:05.166 --> 46:06.208
What's wrong?

46:07.625 --> 46:08.916
What's going on there?

46:10.791 --> 46:11.708
Shimura?

46:16.791 --> 46:17.958
[groaning]

46:20.041 --> 46:20.958
[gasping]

46:24.625 --> 46:25.541
[whimpering]

46:34.791 --> 46:37.041
[music fades]

46:37.125 --> 46:38.666
[boy 1] This is a warning.

46:42.250 --> 46:43.291
[Aki] Shimura?

46:43.833 --> 46:44.875
Is something wrong?

46:44.958 --> 46:46.333
Are you there, Shimura?!

46:46.916 --> 46:48.958
Can you hear me, Shimura?!

46:49.041 --> 46:51.083
Come on! Please answer me!

46:51.708 --> 46:54.375
[Japanese rock music playing]

47:03.541 --> 47:10.541
VIRAL HIT

47:15.750 --> 47:17.625
[Japanese rock music continues]

48:27.166 --> 48:28.166
[music ends]
